# The console's build output. `npm run build` in ../../../../console writes here
# and Go's embed picks it up at compile time.
#
# Nothing in here is committed except this file, and this file is committed for
# one reason: //go:embed refuses to compile against a directory that matches no
# files, so `go build ./...` on a clean clone needs something here. See the
# package comment in ../web.go for why a placeholder beats a build tag.
*
!.gitignore
